/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]The dashboard separates unconfirmed tasks into NEW, keeps confirmed[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]and exempt tasks in READY, and links expired or returned [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]confirmations to rotten.md, with matching live badges and one [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]rotten vocabulary across human and machine views.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]freshness_gated_ready.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/freshness_gated_ready.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-3b[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-3b/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Add cached freshness buckets and matching dashboard models[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]ledger-bucket[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ledger-bucket: add the shared read-time bucket contract in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-ledger-tools and bob-cli, memoize classification and config reads, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]gate the shared READY count, and implement availability-aware NEW/ROTTEN[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]models and live refresh. Cover the partition, fallback, calendar [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]boundaries, and performance; preserve v1 JSON state names until [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]vocab-rotten. Follow the ledger-bucket section below.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Roll out NEW and ROTTEN views, badges, docs, and decisions[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]dash-gating[dim] · [dim][/dim]after ledger-bucket[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]dash-gating: add NEW between TODAY and PENDING, gate READY, rename [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]freshness.md to rotten.md with RETURNED and ROTTEN groups, migrate links[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and badges, and publish the authorized decision/glossary updates. Deploy[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the plugin and vault changes together and verify the actual rendered [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]views. Follow the dash-gating section below, including the two-week [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]trial and rollout checks.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Finish the rotten vocabulary and versioned contract migration[/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]vocab-rotten[dim] · [dim][/dim]after dash-gating[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]vocab-rotten: rename freshness-specific machine state/count/config names[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]in Rust and JavaScript, publish bob freshness JSON schema 2, and support[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the old budget key with a deprecation lint for one release. Update every[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]freshness consumer and conformance test, preserve the bucket contract [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and unrelated stale terminology, then release and verify the final [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]integration. Follow the vocab-rotten section below.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-3b","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-3b.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-76ba31034a4294c95d6b69c78321643b","started_at":"2026-10-01T17:11:16.690356+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[{"committed_at":1790879386,"sha":"e77bbe387ae4a88521a86b962bbb7fb8ae75e469","subject":"feat(freshness): finish rotten vocabulary and versioned contract migration"}